Subject: [PATCH] WPE: enumerate GStreamer cameras without a desktop portal

WPE skips the PipeWire portal. Populate the normal GStreamer device monitor
before completing enumeration, so V4L2 cameras can reach getUserMedia.

--- a/Source/WebCore/platform/mediastream/gstreamer/PipeWireCaptureDeviceManager.cpp
+++ b/Source/WebCore/platform/mediastream/gstreamer/PipeWireCaptureDeviceManager.cpp
@@ -55,6 +55,7 @@
     }
-
+
 #if PLATFORM(WPE)
+    GStreamerVideoCaptureDeviceManager::singleton().captureDevices();
     callback();
     return;
 #endif
